description: >-
  Semantic configurator for orions-belt — runs INSIDE an already-bootstrapped
  target project (post `copier copy`) to scan the real stack, generate an
  applicability report per component (APLICAVEL/NAO_APLICAVEL/
  CONDICIONAL), confirm the CONDICIONAL items with the user, and apply
